WEBVTT

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:09.400
It was only by chance,
but I found a place where I belong.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.860
But even here, I know there will be days where we’ll be fighting, watching the sky.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.980
Still, my hero is here.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.020
And my closest friend is here with me too.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.900
We’ve had many new encounters.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.100
Eventually our feelings will reach the open sky.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.080
Though the wall we must climb is far and tall,
our hearts are set on facing it.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.380
All of us together.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:39.290
Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS<i>
will now begin.</i>

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:38.300
Dad, Ginny, how have you been? This is Subaru.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:47.930
Tia and I have been here at Riot Force 6
for two weeks already.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:51.100
Good morning.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.110
Mornin’.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:56.810
We haven’t fully assembled yet,
so we four forwards are in the same class,

00:02:56.810 --> 00:03:00.080
training from breakfast all the way until dinner.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:03.400
Not to mention we’re still on the lowest level of training.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.990
Good morning, Fried.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:14.040
The training provided by the unit’s instructor,
Nanoha, is rather difficult.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:19.380
But if I can keep up,
I feel like I can become stronger and stronger.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:28.970
As I’m on duty twenty-four hours a day now, I won’t be able to occasionally return home like I used to.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.940
But I’m still planning on asking for leave,
so I can return home on Mom’s anniversary.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.320
Let’s go all out again today!

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:45.400
See ya! I’ll send another letter later.
Love, Subaru.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.420
Okay, fall in!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.200
Yes, ma’am!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.430
We’ll do one last exercise before
we wrap up this morning’s training.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.890
Does everyone feel up to it?

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.300
Yes, ma’am!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.830
In that case, we’ll practice our shooting evasion.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:10.780
Raising Heart!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:12.160
All right.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.560
Accel Shooter

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.310
I’ll be attacking for five minutes.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:25.240
If you can avoid all of my attacks and get a clean hit on me, you’ll clear the exercise.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:29.190
If any one of you are hit,
then all of you will have to start over.

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.820
Give it your best!

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:31.660
Yes, ma’am!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.490
In this worn-out state,
and with Nanoha attacking for five minutes,

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.620
do you have any confidence you can evade her attacks?

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:38.080
None!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:39.080
Same here.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.340
In that case, let’s aim to get a hit in somehow.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.090
Okay!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.550
All right! Let’s go, Erio!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.000
Okay, Subaru!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.180
You’re all ready, right?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.020
In that case...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.370
Ready...

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.300
Go!

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.790
Everyone, be sure to evade!
We’ll beat her in two minutes!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.450
Right!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.350
Accelerate!

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.010
Snipe Shot

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.820
Silhouettes.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.180
Not bad, Teana.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.380
Good reaction time.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:49.570
Subaru, you idiot!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.800
That’s dangerous, you know!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.290
Sorry!

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:55.840
Wait a sec, I’ll shoot them down for you.

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:04.010
Tia, a little help here!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.960
Why now of all times!?

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:11.700
Here they come!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:20.730
Please hear my wish, wings that ride the storm.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.160
Anoint this knight with power to break through.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.880
Boost Up: Acceleration

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:39.330
By the way, the acceleration is really sudden. Be careful!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.750
No problem! Speed is my specialty.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.630
Let’s go, Strada!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.500
Erio! Now!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.400
Here goes!

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.340
Spear Assault

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.700
Erio!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.680
He missed?

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.160
Mission complete.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:27.510
Well done! Mission complete.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.470
Really?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.890
Look, you broke through the barrier
and even reached my Jacket.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:41.060
Well, that’s all for this morning. Let’s clean up.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:41.660
Yes, ma’am!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:52.980
Now then, everyone seems to be getting used to working as a team.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.580
Thank you, ma’am!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.400
Teana, your tactics are becoming more and more reliable.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.540
Would you like to take squad leader training?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:04.020
Not really. I’m already fully occupied with combat training.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.880
Fried, what’s wrong?

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:12.980
Something smells burnt.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:15.580
Subaru, your blades!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.340
Wha?

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.910
O-oh crap! Aw man...

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:26.360
Now I’ve done it! I pushed them too hard.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:30.810
Did they overheat?
Have the maintenance staff look at them later.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.810
Yes, ma’am.

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.440
Teana, your Anchor Gun has been having problems too?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.780
Yes. I’m using every trick I’ve got.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.610
Everyone’s been using the training equipment.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:44.210
I guess it’s time to switch to
the new Devices for active combat.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.340
New...

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:46.300
...Devices?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:55.170
Okay, use the facility’s shower,
change your clothes, and meet up in the lobby.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:55.940
Yes, ma’am!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.820
That car is...

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.700
Fate, Commander Yagami!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.060
Incredible!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.870
So this is your car, Captain Fate?

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.820
That’s right. I use it for getting around while on the ground.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.250
How’s everyone’s training coming along?

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.620
We’re doing our best.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:28.040
Erio, Caro, I’m sorry. I’m your captain, but I haven’t been looking after you two.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.920
No, not at all.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.170
We’re doing fine.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.870
The four of them are all looking good
and getting the hang of it.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.130
They should be good to deploy at any time.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:39.110
Is that so? That’s reassuring to hear.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.060
Are you two going out somewhere?

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:45.010
Yeah, just to Port Six.

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:48.980
I’m going to talk to Carim at Church HQ.
I’ll be back before evening.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:54.310
I’ll be back before lunch.
Would everyone like to eat lunch together?

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:55.330
Yes, ma’am!

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.900
See you then!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.670
A mage-knight with the Church of the Holy King’s Knights,

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:08.110
and a board member of the Bureau’s Main Office, Carim Gracia, huh?

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.490
I’ve never met her before.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.390
I guess you haven’t, huh?

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:14.680
How long have you known her, Hayate?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:22.920
When I was first summoned to work with
the Church Knights, Rein was only just born, so...

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.090
...around eight years.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.170
I see.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:32.140
Carim and I usually have completely different beliefs, positions, and tasks that we undertake.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:35.620
But this time our objectives are the same.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:41.620
Carim was actually the one responsible for getting Riot Force 6 off the ground.

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.580
Is that so?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:47.040
Thanks to her, I’m able to concentrate on gathering personnel.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.000
So she feels like a trustworthy superior?

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:56.520
Her job and abilities are really impressive,
but she doesn’t feel much like a superior.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:59.190
If I had to choose, I’d say she’s more like a big sister.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:01.210
I see.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:05.930
Well, after we take care of the Relic Incident, I’ll make sure to introduce you to her.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.340
I’m sure you two will get along well with her, both you and Nanoha.

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.370
Sure. I’ll be looking forward to it.

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:20.290
Hey, Subaru, your rollerblades,
and your gun, Tia, are both homemade, right?

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.180
That’s right.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:27.370
In training school and my last unit, we were only provided staves.

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:32.070
I use Belkan magic...
it suits my fighting style better.

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:35.560
Tia said she wanted to use a Cartridge System also.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:38.580
So we had no choice but to make them ourselves.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:43.460
The training school didn’t have original Device users, so we kind of stood out.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:48.790
Ohhh.... is that how you became friends?

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:53.280
It was the start of my days of agony and
our inseparable relationship that I never wanted.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.710
Now then Caro, want me to wash your hair?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.610
Please do!

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:06.490
I’m heading out first.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:07.920
Okay!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.000
Is everyone done yet?

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.320
Knight Carim, Knight Hayate has arrived.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:13:00.830
She arrived rather quickly, didn’t she?
Please send her to my office.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:01.950
Yes, ma’am.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:07.460
Also, bring some of tea, please.
A nice brew of first leaf with milk and sugar, please.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.190
Certainly, milady.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.780
All right.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.450
Please come in.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.250
Carim! Long time no see.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:26.430
Hayate, welcome.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.380
Sorry it’s been so long since I last visited.

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:36.050
Don’t worry about it.
Looks like the unit is progressing well.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.300
Thanks to you, Carim.

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:43.140
If you say that, then it’ll be easier to ask you for a favor.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.860
What’s that? Today’s appointment was to request a favor?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:05.810
Gadgets? New models?

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:09.310
Besides the one we already know,
there are two new models.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:15.880
Their combat abilities are still unknown,
but Type 3 here is rather large.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:20.070
I haven’t formally reported this to the Main Office yet.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:23.770
I want to at least let
Admiral Chrono know about this problem.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:25.670
This is...!

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.980
This is why I arranged for us to meet today.

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:32.110
We discovered it the day before last,
being transported to Midchilda.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.600
That’s a Relic, isn’t it?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:39.550
There’s a very good chance it is.
Types 2 and 3 were discovered yesterday, as well.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:43.050
How long do you think we have until the Gadgets find the Relic?

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:45.750
From our reports, it could be as soon as today or tomorrow.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:50.440
You’re right, but it’s strange.
It seems way too soon for a Relic to appear again.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:57.540
That’s why I wanted to talk to you...
to figure out how to judge and react to this.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:04.920
We can’t afford to botch the Relic Incident—or any of the incidents that are bound to follow.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.800
Hayate?

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:16.260
Well, no matter what happens, everything will work out.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:22.010
Because you’ve lent us your strength, Carim, the unit is now ready to deploy at any time.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:26.730
Of course, the captains were ready from the start, but the new forwards are also combat ready.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:31.850
If unexpected situations or emergencies arise,
we’ll be able to deal with them.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.450
That’s why it’ll all work out!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.090
Ah, these are...

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:42.390
Are these our new Devices?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.620
That’s right!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:50.770
I’m the designer, with help from Nanoha, Fate, Raising Heart, and Command Sergeant Major Rein.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.940
Strada and Kerykeion don’t seem to be any different though.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:58.150
Yeah, I’m thinking the same thing.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:15:59.340
Bzzzt!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.340
Only the outside appearance is unchanged.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.060
Rein!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.450
Yes indeedy!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:09.140
Because you two haven’t had any real experience with Devices before,

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:14.020
we used only the basic frame and provided only minimal functions to let you get used to the feeling.

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.400
T-Those had minimal functions?

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.490
Really?

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:24.010
The four Devices that you will be using are
the latest creations by Riot Force 6’s front-line troops

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:27.680
and the mechanics team,
after combining their experience and expertise,

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.940
to meet this unit’s objectives.

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:35.820
Also, Erio and Caro, Subaru and Tia, to meet your needs,

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.200
we’ve made the best Devices we could come up with!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.930
These children have only just been born,

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.930
but they’ve been entrusted with
a lot of people’s hopes and dreams.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:51.690
After a really long time, they are finally complete.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.110
Don’t just think of them as just tools or weapons.
Treat them as if they were precious.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:17:00.540
But please, use them at their full potential!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:05.290
Yes. I’m sure they’d want you to do that as well.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.000
Sorry, sorry. Thank you for waiting.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.570
Nanoha!

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:12.670
Nice timing. I was just about to explain how to use them.

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.270
Really? They’ll soon be in usable condition, right?

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:16.810
Yep!

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:24.220
First, they all have several stages of power limiters installed in them.

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:29.470
The first stage won’t be so powerful as to surprise you,

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.190
so get used to using that first.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:36.020
And when you’re able to handle the current power efficiently,

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:40.840
depending on my, Captain Fate, Rein,
or Shari’s judgment, we’ll release a limiter.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:44.440
You can think of it as levelling up together.

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:49.580
Just curious... these power limiters...
you and the others have them too, right, Nanoha?

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:54.300
Yes, but in our case, it’s not just for our Devices
but for us physically as well.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.970
With a limiter?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.170
They’re called ability limiters.

00:17:59.170 --> 00:18:02.170
All of our captains and lieutenants have one.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:06.860
Captain Fate and I, Lieutenants Signum and Vita...

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.550
Hayate too.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:09.400
Right.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:17.280
You know! To prevent jealously between units,
the brass balances the mage ranks of each unit evenly.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.950
Oh, yeah! That’s right.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:28.870
In cases where many excellent mages are in one unit,
ability limiters are used to keep the peace.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.790
Well, there are still some that play dirty.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.940
In our case, Commander Hayate
is four ranks down,

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:39.010
and we captains are something like two ranks down.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:43.460
Four? Commander Yagami should be SS rank, so...

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:46.070
She was dropped to A rank?

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:49.220
Hayate has it tough with many things too.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.940
What about you, Nanoha?

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:56.890
I’m normally S+. So two ranks down, and I’m AA.

00:18:56.890 --> 00:19:01.370
So I might have a tough time alone against all of you soon.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:06.050
The captains require Hayate’s permission,

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:09.220
but Hayate needs permission from her direct superior Carim,

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:15.220
or from the unit’s inspector, Admiral Chrono. Otherwise, we can’t remove the limiters.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.260
And it doesn’t seem that easy to get approval either.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.220
Is that so?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:25.420
Well, you can keep the talk about
the captains in a corner of your mind.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:27.860
Right now, it’s about your Devices.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:28.530
Okay.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:29.640
Yes, ma’am.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:34.100
The new Devices are tuned using your training data,

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:37.070
so even if you jump into using them, they shouldn’t feel out of place.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:40.980
Let’s use this afternoon’s training for testing and re-adjusting.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:46.520
They can do self-adjustments,
so it should be mostly taken care of.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:50.530
The latest ones sure are convenient.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:51.730
Convenient they are!

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:57.160
In Subaru’s case, Revolver Knuckle’s synchro function has been set.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.790
Really?

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:03.820
To make it easier to carry,
a storage and instant boot function were installed.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.750
Thank you!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:14.020
Yeah, Hayate should have already arrived.

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.440
Okay, thanks for your hard work.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:21.730
After this I’m planning on going to visit Public Safety’s investigation office.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.320
Do you have any urgent tasks or anything?

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.950
No, we’re fine over here.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:32.550
The lieutenants have deployed with
the reserve forces, but Nanoha is here in the office.

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.420
I see.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.040
This alert is...

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.160
First alert warning!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:45.590
Griffith!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.900
Ma’am! It’s a deployment request from Church headquarters.

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:53.150
Captain Nanoha, Captain Fate,
Griffith, this is Hayate.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.360
What’s the situation?

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:59.480
The item the Church investigators were after,
a Relic-like object, has been found.

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:05.040
It’s located in the Mountain District.
The item is moving along the Third Linear Rail.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.290
Moving?

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.070
It can’t be!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:15.540
Yes, it can. The intruding Gadgets have caused the vehicle to go out of control.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.460
In the worst-case scenario, there could be thirty machines other than the Linear Rail ones.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.770
Two new types might appear as well: a large type and an unknown type.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:28.350
It’ll be a difficult mission for starters, but Nanoha, Fate, can you do it?

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.010
I can go any time.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:31.430
Me too.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:35.350
Subaru, Teana, Erio, Caro!
Is everyone else ready as well?

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.310
Yes, ma’am!

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.530
Yes, good reply.

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:43.160
Shift A-3, Griffith will take command.
Rein will observe the situation.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:44.210
Yes, ma’am!

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:46.150
Nanoha and Fate will take command at the scene.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.420
Right!

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:48.890
In that case,

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:51.870
Riot Force 6 forward squads:

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:52.720
Move out!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:53.870
Yes ma’am!

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:58.040
Roger! Everyone go on ahead. I’ll catch up soon.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:58.810
Got it!

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:12.630
Schach, take Hayate all the way to
Riot Force 6’s headquarters as quickly as possible.

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:14.750
Acknowledged, Knight Carim.

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:18.360
Go to the church’s back door.
Schach will be waiting.

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:18.800
OK.

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:22.440
Thanks a lot, Carim. Today’s tea was delicious.

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:26.570
Well then, I’m off.

00:22:31.420 --> 00:22:33.980
Even though we’re using the new Devices without testing,

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:36.240
they should be just like the ones from training.

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:37.000
Okay.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.460
We’ll do our best.

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:41.880
Erio, Caro, and Fried, hang in there!

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:43.340
Yes, ma’am!

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:49.150
If it gets dangerous, make sure you follow what Captain Fate, Rein, or I say.

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:52.720
Keep your wits about you,
and see this all the way through!

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:53.890
Yes, ma’am!

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:05.040
Are you okay?

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:08.400
Sorry, I’m okay.

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:17.980
Nice to meet you!

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:22.620
Although it may be a bit sudden,
let’s do our best together, buddy!

00:25:17.420 --> 00:25:20.240
Our first deployment
and our first real combat.

00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:22.440
I feel butterflies in my stomach.

00:25:22.440 --> 00:25:26.750
With the feelings and new power
I’ve been entrusted with, I’ll face it straight on.

00:25:33.050 --> 00:25:34.490
Take off!
